matters.rawNotes:
This matter has important complications, originated by the cession of rights made by a private individual in favour of the Municipal Government of Tonalá. However, these rights affected a portion of approximately 10 hectares owned by our client;
The situation is aggravated after the aforementioned Municipality donated the area received to the Industrial Technical Education Center (CETI Tonalá), who later incorporated its property as a National Property under the special regime that corresponds to it.
The firm's work in this case will focus on seeking the nullity of the administrative acts that allowed the irregular actions of the authorities, with the objective of recovering our client's property or obtaining indemnification as payment for the area of land that was unduly taken from our client.

